d.</summary></entry><entry><title>Handwritten 200-year-old P45 found on roof tile</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c6jdmdzv25r9o#0</id><updated>2026-11-12T07:28:56Z</updated><published>2026-11-12T06:14:34Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c6jdmdzv25r9o--6dbbab1ff0cc.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c6jdmdzv25r9o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">The tile informs a worker that he is no longer needed and was signed by Thomas Austin.</summary></entry><entry><title>Government could clean up huge illegal waste dump</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cm4gnz9g2x75o#1</id><updated>2026-11-12T07:28:59Z</updated><published>2026-11-12T06:12:39Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cm4gnz9g2x75o--dcd9ebe81b4a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cm4gnz9g2x75o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">The field near the M57 in Kirkby, Merseyside contains about 30,000 tonnes of heavy duty rubbish.</summary></entry><entry><title>Spinal surgery delay for teen with 'stabbing pain'</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ckdd8d10y832o#1</id><updated>2026-11-12T07:29:02Z</updated><published>2026-11-12T06:14:46Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ckdd8d10y832o--bd95c0be2f96.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ckdd8d10y832o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">Jessica, 14, has been waiting longer than a year for spinal surgery to correct her painful scoliosis.</summary></entry><entry><title>How climate change is affecting children's wellbeing</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cgewp315480o#1</id><updated>2026-11-12T07:29:05Z</updated><published>2026-11-12T06:16:07Z</published><link rel="alternat